# ============================================================
#  Sentinel AI — real CCTV camera configuration
# ============================================================
# 1. Copy this file to ".env"  (same folder as main.py)
# 2. Fill in the RTSP URL(s) for the camera(s) you have connected.
# 3. Restart the backend:  python main.py
#
# Any camera left blank / removed keeps showing the demo placeholder.
#
# --- RTSP URL formats by brand -------------------------------
# Hikvision : rtsp://USER:PASS@CAM_IP:554/Streaming/Channels/101   (101=main, 102=sub)
# Dahua     : rtsp://USER:PASS@CAM_IP:554/cam/realmonitor?channel=1&subtype=0
# Reolink   : rtsp://USER:PASS@CAM_IP:554/h264Preview_01_main
# TP-Link   : rtsp://USER:PASS@CAM_IP:554/stream1
#
# TIP: the sub-stream (Hikvision "102") is lower resolution and much lighter
#      on CPU — recommended for smooth live analytics.
# ------------------------------------------------------------

# Main Gate — In (ANPR + Face)
CAM01_RTSP=rtsp://admin:YOUR_PASSWORD@192.168.1.64:554/Streaming/Channels/102

# The rest are optional — uncomment and fill in as you add more cameras:
# CAM02_RTSP=
# CAM12_RTSP=
# CAM08_RTSP=
# CAM05_RTSP=
